## 1. Why these two next

**japanophile-mcp** proved the stack: five portmanteau MCP tools, seed DBs, vendored knowledge + language curriculum HTML, Practice games iframe bridge, HTTP + `/mcp`, Vite dashboard, Tauri NSIS, `.mcpb`. Recent IA refresh (**Language · Knowledge · Practice · MCP Tools**) and curriculum tabs (keigo, exams, materials, mobile, bloopers) are the **target UX** for sisters — not the older “Learn · Know · Games” labels in the 2025 pattern doc.

| Sister | Primary personal fit | Existing fleet leverage |
|--------|----------------------|-------------------------|
| **austrophile-mcp** | Vienna resident; ÖSD/Deutsch; Kaffeehaus culture | [mywienerlinien](../mywienerlinien/), [gtfs-mcp](../gtfs-mcp/), **Calibre-Bibliothek Deutsch**, contributor **[vienna-living](#48-vienna-living-contributor-repo)** |
| **sinophile-mcp** | Long-horizon Chinese; HSK; history box ( **high editorial finesse** ) | ai-games-collection (if any CN drills), calibre-mcp; charter [sinophile-mcp/EDITORIAL_CHARTER.md](./sinophile-mcp/EDITORIAL_CHARTER.md) |

**Recommended build order:** **austrophile-mcp first** (smaller language surface, Plan face can delegate transit to existing Vienna MCPs), then **sinophile-mcp** (hanzi + tones + two scripts = larger data and curriculum lift). **Sinophile Knowledge is not a fast fork** — politics/history pages wait until [EDITORIAL_CHARTER.md](./sinophile-mcp/EDITORIAL_CHARTER.md) and Taiwan outline are implemented with human review.

