## 2. Shared architecture (copy from japanophile, do not reinvent)

### Surfaces (unchanged)

1. **stdio MCP** — Cursor / Claude Desktop  
2. **HTTP** — FastAPI REST + static games/assets + streamable `/mcp`  
3. **Human** — Vite React + optional Tauri sidecar + `.mcpb`

Single implementation in `server.py`; HTTP mirrors tools.

### Webapp IA (2026 japanophile standard)

| Sidebar | Role |
|---------|------|
| **Dashboard** | Health, corpus KPIs, session progress |
| **Language** | Curriculum HTML tabs (overview, writing, grammar, vocabulary, phonetics, methods, materials, mobile, exams, culture-specific tabs) |
| **Knowledge** | Society/history/economy HTML box + cluster tabs |
| **Travel** | Plan face (stub → tools) |
| **Diary** | Remember face (stub → SQLite) |
| **Practice** | Vendored or repo-local drill iframes |
| **Chat** | local-llm-mcp + `{culture}-expert` skill |
| **MCP Tools** | Full portmanteau harness |
| **Settings / Help / Skills / Apps** | Fleet parity |

Keep thin **Learn** route optional (MCP demo quiz only), not in sidebar.

### Data tiers

| Tier | Git | Notes |
|------|-----|--------|
| Seeds | Yes (≤5–10 MB each) | Quiz bank, compact lexicon |
| Big corpora | Fetch script | CC-CEDICT, full frequency lists, audio |
| Runtime | Gitignored | `progress.db`, diary, SRS |

Missing big data → dialogic fetch hint, never traceback.

### Editorial

Same as japanophile: **sourced, neutral** culture writing; skill refuses propaganda. Sensitive topics (PRC politics, Habsburg nostalgia, etc.) get dates and citations, not hot takes.

### Crossconnects (all sisters)

- **calibre-mcp** — Materials tabs cite owned ebooks; publisher search before duplicate buys. Fleet owner estate (~15k titles, split libraries): [CALIBRE_OWNER_ESTATE.md](./CALIBRE_OWNER_ESTATE.md)  
- **speech-mcp** — pronunciation drills  
- **local-llm-mcp** — Chat  
- **ai-games-collection** — pure arcade stays there; learning canonical in `*-phile-mcp`  
- **discord-mcp** — reminders, not curriculum  

